Name: UKCP18 Marine climate projections
Description: UKCP18 Marine projections provide information on future changes in sea level and marine conditions around the UK under different greenhouse gas emissions scenarios. The projections include changes in mean sea level, extreme sea levels, storm surges and wave climate, supporting coastal flood risk assessment, adaptation planning and long-term coastal management. The data has been converted to cloud-optimised Zarr v3 data stores.
